ions of the string from Git history. \\n\\nRedact text \\n\\n#####  Repository cleanup \\n\\nUpload a text file of objects, and then GitLab removes internal Git references to these objects. Use [ git filter-repo ](https://github.com/newren/git-filter-repo) on the repository to generate the list of objects to remove as a commit-map file. [ ](/help/user/project/repository/repository_size.md#repository-cleanup \"What happens during repository cleanup?\")\\n\\n######  Upload commit-map file \\n\\nChoose a file  No file selected \\n\\nThe maximum file size is 100 MiB. \\n\\nStart cleanup \\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/docs-template-repo/-/settings/repository', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', error=False, observation='browse', goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/docs-template-repo/-/settings/repository'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"goto('http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/docs-template-repo/-/settings/repository')\", last_browser_action_error='', focused_element_bid='78'), BrowseInteractiveAction(browser_actions=\"click('722')\", thought='', browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action='browse_interactive', security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content=\"Skip to main content \\n\\n##  Primary navigation \\n\\n[ Homepage  ](/)\\n\\nCreate new... \\n\\n  * In this project \\n\\n    * [ New issue  ](/root/docs-template-repo/-/issues/new)\\n    * [ New merge request  ](/root/docs-template-repo/-/merge_requests/new)\\n    * [ New snippet  ](/root/docs-template-repo/-/snippets/new)\\n    * Invite team members \\n  * In GitLab \\n\\n    * [ New project/repository  ](/projects/new)\\n    * [ New group  ](/groups/new)\\n    * [ New snippet  ](/-/snippets/new)\\n\\n\\n\\nAdministrator user\u2019s menu \\n\\n  *     * [ Administrator  @root  ](/root)\\n  *     * Set status \\n    * [ Edit profile  ](/-/user_settings/profile)\\n    * [ Preferences  ](/-/profile/preferences)\\n  *     * [ Sign ou